contracts/pons-v2 — licence map

Our code (MIT)
--------------
Files under src/ named BuilderPad*.sol, script/, test/ and this project's
configuration are released under the MIT License (see the repository root
LICENSE). Copyright (c) 2026 BuilderPad contributors.

Forked code (MIT) — Pons v2
---------------------------
Most of src/ is an identifier-only rename (PonsV2* -> BuilderPad*) of the
Pons v2 launchpad contracts by Pons, https://github.com/ponsdotdev/ponsfamily
(contractsV2/src/v2 @ 79e99efd9d4fab7138b1a5524b907b2f5aae6586, overlaid with
the Blockscout-verified sources of the live deployment). Every such file
carries its original `SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT` header. BuilderPadFeeEscrow.sol
is ours (upstream ships only the interface). See UPSTREAM.txt for the exact
provenance and docs/PONS_FORK.md for what changed. This fork is not affiliated
with or endorsed by Pons.

