Vendored third-party code (lib/)
--------------------------------
  lib/openzeppelin-contracts   MIT            OpenZeppelin
  lib/forge-std                MIT / Apache-2 Foundry
  lib/v4-periphery             MIT            Uniswap Labs (interfaces + libraries only)
  lib/v4-hooks-public          MIT            Uniswap Labs (BaseHook)
  lib/v4-core                  MIT            Uniswap Labs — interfaces, types and
                                              libraries, EXCEPT:
    lib/v4-core/src/libraries/Pool.sol       BUSL-1.1
    lib/v4-core/src/libraries/Position.sol   BUSL-1.1

The two BUSL-1.1 files are Uniswap v4 core math libraries (Change Date
2027-06-15, Change License GPL-2.0-or-later) and are linked into
BuilderPadGraduationGuard / BuilderPadMemeHook exactly as upstream Pons v2
does. They are redistributed here unmodified under the terms of the Business
Source License 1.1; see the licence text at
https://github.com/Uniswap/v4-core/blob/main/licenses/BUSL_LICENSE and the
Additional Use Grant at v4-core-license-grants.uniswap.eth. Production use of
those two files is subject to that licence, not to MIT. The deployed pools
themselves run on Uniswap's official PoolManager on Robinhood Chain; nothing
from v4-core is redeployed by this project.
